From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 8 Sep 2026 10:04:21 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] UefiPayloadPkg: Add NVRAM-controlled bootsplash with Setup UI

[ouroBIOS: commit dfb8d33d966a of MrChromebox's edk2, without the files
that TianoCore's tree does not have (tools/edk2-import.py): 7 in
edk2/OuroBiosPkg]

Allow enabling/disabling the boot splash and selecting a custom BMP via
EFI variables and a Platform Setup formset. Draw the default splash
before ConnectAll; connect first only when a custom filesystem logo is
selected. Fall back to the embedded LogoDxe image when the custom path
is missing or invalid, and keep default splash behavior when variables
are unavailable.

Signed-off-by: Matt DeVillier <matt.devillier@gmail.com>
